        "description": "The bard is a 6th-level spellcaster using Charisma. Base spell save DC 15 and +7 to hit with spell attacks; with the Moonlit Focus equipped this becomes DC 16 and +8. Spell slots: 4 x 1st, 3 x 2nd, 3 x 3rd.",
